STLC: Branches

Purpose:
  Software Testing Life Cycle branch standards.
  Defines test environment branches and test promotion rules.

Branches:
  test:
    purpose: Automated test execution environment
    protection: optional
    promotion: stage
    merge_strategy: merge
    test_types:
      - unit
      - integration
      - e2e
      - bdd
      - performance
      - security

Rules:
  [STLC1] Test branches run only changed files — full regression on unchanged code only.
  [STLC2] Test results MUST be recorded in projects/{project_name}/testing/.
  [STLC3] Failed tests MUST block merge to next stage.
  [STLC4] Test coverage MUST meet threshold before merge.
  [STLC5] Performance tests MUST pass for stage promotion.
  [STLC6] Security tests MUST pass for main promotion.

State: +
